invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_ticket.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: Ticket.fromOnTicket zeroes the ticket's binding when it copies what
  on_ticket handed over, so a TRUST=webpki ticket no longer names the
  configuration that received it and init refuses to resume with it. The
  full handshake still completes, so only a resumption notices.
  loop_record.zig and loop_quic.zig resume the ticket they took, and object.

--- old
        out.ticket.identity = null;
--- new
        out.ticket.identity = null;
        if (@hasField(c.ch_ticket, "binding")) out.ticket.binding = @splat(0);
